        <figcaption class="chart-title">The invisible offenders</figcaption>
        <svg viewBox="0 0 600 232" role="img" aria-label="A table of invisible and look-alike characters: zero-width space U+200B, non-breaking space U+00A0, and curly quote U+201C, with where each comes from and what it breaks.">
          <rect x="20" y="12" width="560" height="34" rx="8" fill="#F3E2D6"/>
          <text x="34" y="34" font-family="Karla, sans-serif" font-size="12" font-weight="700" fill="#8a4429">Character</text>
