        <li>TechCrunch, <a href="https://techcrunch.com/2024/08/04/openai-built-a-tool-that-could-detect-text-written-by-chatgpt-but-wont-release-it/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">OpenAI's text watermarking method</a> (biases word choice, not invisible characters, 2024).</li>
        <li>Wikipedia, <a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mojibake" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Mojibake</a> (the UTF-8 vs Windows-1252 encoding mismatch).</li>
